Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on a journey out to see\Nthe world While I'm on my own,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've yet to reach the end So won't\Nyou come along with me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely then we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.80,0:00:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me now as we\Njourney on from sea to sea
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.98,0:00:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,For that treasure known\Nby everybody as one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though they laugh and\Nsay it's just a fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.64,0:00:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We are going, there's no doubt we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we can feel the\Nrush of energy overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.04,0:00:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It will lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.28,0:00:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep pretending that you know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Books will only get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:01:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No guides for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.14,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry soon, the rain\Nwill be gone with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.06,0:01:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your chin up, raise the\Nanchor, now that's what you'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.68,0:01:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it time and calm the storm\Nthat you have built within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and have my board at number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Once tomorrow's wind picks up,\Nwe set stuff cause we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.86,0:01:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thresh enough, stand tall and\Ntake a look at one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.38,0:01:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All the journey makes\Nme wanna see somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.74,0:01:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There are things out there\Nyou just won't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.68,0:01:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.38,0:01:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the story most will believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.36,0:01:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me, come and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.32,0:01:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I am on a journey out to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.84,0:01:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The world done on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.40,0:01:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got my group of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Together we've got our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.44,0:01:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Says your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.12,0:01:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who says it can't be done?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't even tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta just believe we'll\Nmake it to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanna do it all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:02:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Together surely we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.90,0:02:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.80,0:02:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this moment in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.84,0:02:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this feeling in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.26,0:02:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.56,0:02:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.34,0:02:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.25,0:02:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.10,0:02:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.28,0:02:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see some more\Nninja moves! Neen, neen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Neen, neen for a lifetime!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.12,0:02:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What you saw was not meant to be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.70,0:02:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.36,0:02:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But you were putting on a show.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.48,0:02:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Peaceful, not her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.04,0:02:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.90,0:03:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.81,0:03:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.73,0:03:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.64,0:03:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.58,0:03:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not be absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.78,0:03:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Men from 1.0 never cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.70,0:03:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But my heart weep because\Nthis beautiful land
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.06,0:03:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,was not in such a sorry\Nstate when I arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.28,0:03:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The streets were bustling with life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.96,0:03:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Smiles shone on the people's faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.52,0:03:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The country was overflowing with life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This was too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I am unworthy of such loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.74,0:04:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But I vow to avenge you and repay\Nthe kindness you've shown me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.88,0:04:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So I pray you will forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.22,0:04:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yugara! Good news!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.16,0:04:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems the deciphering\Nof the stone is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.02,0:04:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back inside the whale.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.98,0:04:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:04:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You got all this information\Nfrom the Poneglyph, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,With this data, I can\Ndraw up a nautical chart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.60,0:05:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we can pinpoint the\Nlocation of something, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.12,0:05:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This stone has a special name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.10,0:05:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a road Poneglyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.76,0:05:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,As you, Karoo, know,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,all of the major players are searching\Nfor the end point of the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.04,0:05:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That stone is a guide to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.62,0:05:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why the whale forest is held\Nto be sacred by the Mink tribe,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.40,0:05:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and why us guardians are sworn\Nto protect it no matter the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.66,0:05:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The end of the Grand\NLine is within our grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.32,0:05:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a guide to the final\Nisland, to Laugh-Tail?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisely so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.36,0:05:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.27,0:05:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.84,0:05:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If I go there, I'll be\Nking of the pirates! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.70,0:05:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.38,0:05:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.26,0:05:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Laugh-Tail at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like that\Nflower-head guy told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.54,0:06:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All we needed was this\Nred thing all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.52,0:06:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just, uh, let me finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.16,0:06:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This stone here isn't\Nthe only red pony glyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.74,0:06:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There are four, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.92,0:06:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There are four left, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.98,0:06:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy! Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.72,0:06:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the dog talk
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.76,0:06:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The stone does provide a location But\Nthe coordinates, at least on their own,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.14,0:06:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,do not point to Laugh Tale itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.24,0:06:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The other three road\Nponeglyphs provide the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.00,0:06:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Coordinates to different places.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.08,0:06:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.12,0:06:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,when you, Karoo, have determined\Nall four of those locations,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.60,0:06:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,then connect the points on a map,\Ntheir true purpose will be apparent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.72,0:07:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the points cross,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.28,0:07:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,you, Karoo, will find the final island!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.52,0:07:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,which was only reached once by\Nthe King of the Pirates long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Laugh Tale at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.60,0:07:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's closer than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.74,0:07:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The final island!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.46,0:07:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we get there, we'll know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it actually real or just a legend?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.40,0:07:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, it's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.46,0:07:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't go where exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.82,0:07:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of a big world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.18,0:07:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get Sanji, then\Nwe'll get the One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.12,0:07:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to do that all on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.96,0:07:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.98,0:08:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,if you gotta travel to Whole\NCake Island with Peccoms,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.22,0:08:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,that might actually help us\Nkill two birds with one stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.24,0:08:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,As I mentioned, there\Nare four road poneglyphs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.36,0:08:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We know the location of three of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.08,0:08:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,One's right here, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.46,0:08:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And two under the control of\Npirates, and powerful ones at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.14,0:08:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Go figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.64,0:08:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom's the first one on the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.60,0:08:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And the second another emperor\Nkaido king of the beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.58,0:08:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So we just gotta rob him, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.82,0:08:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.62,0:08:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like all I can see\Nin front of me is darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.70,0:08:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can relate. Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.48,0:08:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fight both of them at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.14,0:08:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta kick their butt sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.16,0:08:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's some sensitivity here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.58,0:08:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't ready for all of\Nthis to happen so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.86,0:08:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's scary as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.02,0:08:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, don't think I won't pee my pants\Nbecause I totally will, damn straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.34,0:08:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pee my pants too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.64,0:08:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.55,0:08:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.02,0:09:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta don't need to steal\Nthe poneglyphs or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.02,0:09:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Reckless like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.26,0:09:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.00,0:09:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you gonna gonna lug\Naround a stone that size anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.66,0:09:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take an etching or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.08,0:09:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,then translate it once you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.46,0:09:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.48,0:09:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just sneak into Big\NMom's and Kaido's hideouts,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.60,0:09:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,avoid any dangerous confrontations!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.88,0:09:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,make a copy, and then bam!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.56,0:09:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll sell straight to Laugh\NTale before they know any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.78,0:09:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll be king of the\Npirates, and everyone is happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.18,0:09:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that face is\Na good plan, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.84,0:09:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's lame and weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.90,0:09:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to kick butt and be manly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.96,0:09:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprise, hearty, straight here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.66,0:09:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.74,0:09:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're the one I'm worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.12,0:09:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This could get rather tricky, Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.56,0:10:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who are interested in the blank\Ncentury are also hunting down pornoglyphs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.96,0:10:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and recording their data.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.44,0:10:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, that's all fine and good,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.22,0:10:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but the problem is that none of them can
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.74,0:10:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,actually read the text\Neven if they find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.28,0:10:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So what happens when all those\Nbig shots hit a dead end?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They're likely going to kidnap the\Nonly person capable of reading them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.78,0:10:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Namely, you gotta...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.30,0:10:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.21,0:10:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Kidnap Robin? Hell no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.26,0:10:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.26,0:10:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.88,0:10:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I know they'll protect me\Nno matter what may happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.32,0:10:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Robin, you don't have\Nto flatter me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.32,0:10:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.70,0:10:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kick butt for you any old time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.04,0:10:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm only kind of strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.36,0:11:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I vow to protect you with my life\Nand my life after death as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.76,0:11:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I will do anything to protect Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.58,0:11:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She's super!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.58,0:11:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No one is laying a finger on Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.54,0:11:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Or I'll take their lives and their money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.38,0:11:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like they've\Ngot things covered, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky to have\Nsuch reliable friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.64,0:11:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, why do the Minx happen to be\Nso knowledgeable about the Poneglyphs?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.56,0:11:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We have our old lord\Nto thank for that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.06,0:11:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Kozuki Oden had a\Ngreat interest in the stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.44,0:11:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only natural,\Nconsidering his history.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.30,0:11:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The story is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.66,0:11:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mutt, is it alright for\Nme to tell them all this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.64,0:11:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you may proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.32,0:12:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They are allies, and they are trustworthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.08,0:12:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We need not keep secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.10,0:12:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The deal is the Kozuki clan\Nfrom the land of Wano is a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.68,0:12:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,family of talented stonemasons\Nand has been for generations
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact this very day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.48,0:12:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They're still probably the\Nbest in the world stonemasons
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Since long back 800 years or so at least
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.46,0:12:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,They used their talents to construct stone\Ndocuments that could not be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.34,0:12:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, they made the Poneglyphs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.24,0:12:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All the stones were made by them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.92,0:12:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And I never knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.20,0:12:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You made those rocks that Robin likes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.74,0:12:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.10,0:13:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.02,0:13:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He was my ancestors from many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.64,0:13:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then do you know what they say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.32,0:13:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that would be real handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.20,0:13:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that such details\Nwere not passed on to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.40,0:13:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll simply have to\Nread them as was intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.32,0:13:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing passed down is\Nthe method to decipher the text.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.06,0:13:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But even that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.24,0:13:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a most tragic tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.58,0:13:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Before the method could be\Ntaught to Lord Momonosuke,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.36,0:13:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,His father Kozuki Odin met\Nan exceedingly cruel fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.84,0:13:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,By cruel fate you mean to say\Nthat Momonosuke's father is dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.86,0:13:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed Lord Odin is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.52,0:13:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And Wano is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.00,0:14:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wano, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.22,0:14:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Odin, and I was born to boil!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.48,0:14:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, if this is too hard,\Nyou don't have to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.40,0:14:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Odin was executed by
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.50,0:14:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,order of the Shogun of Wano,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.34,0:15:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,who is in an alliance\Nwith the pirate Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.30,0:15:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet he faced his demise willingly,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.58,0:15:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,with courage, in order to\Nsave all of his retainers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.82,0:15:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He fought with Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.78,0:15:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This runs deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.52,0:15:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Even today, the foul Emperor\NKaido and his beast pirate crew
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You are still in one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.12,0:15:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can't go back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.24,0:15:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm not trying to\Ntwist the knife here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.24,0:15:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But why was this lord of yours\Nexecuted in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.80,0:15:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why you have to hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.82,0:15:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you've got people hunting you down?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, it is as you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.90,0:16:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We are being pursued because of the grievous\Ncrime that our lord was charged with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.96,0:16:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But Kaido doesn't want our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.66,0:16:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather, he wants to pry\Ninformation out of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.00,0:16:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,For Lord Odin, who was\Nthe previous Daimyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.86,0:16:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sailed the seas with the pirate Gold D.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger And gazed upon the\Nfinal island: Laugh Tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.74,0:16:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And there he witnessed the secrets\Nof the world with his own eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.20,0:16:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.92,0:17:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo's dad was on Roger's crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.62,0:17:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So the lord of these samurai,\Nhe made it to Laugh Tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.44,0:17:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell us any of that stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.00,0:17:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A man who learned the world's secrets,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.92,0:17:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,probably alongside Rayleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.18,0:17:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.26,0:17:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We learned all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.70,0:17:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,the entirety of the missing history.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.66,0:17:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're saying that Kaido was\Nusing Doflamingo and Caesar to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.10,0:17:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,try and learn these secrets of\Nthe world or whatever from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.50,0:17:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,since you guys were Odin's servants?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.22,0:17:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's correct, Sorzoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.82,0:17:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We know nothing on this subject matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.80,0:17:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Odin made certain not to\Nburden us with any secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, we possess no knowledge of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.82,0:18:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Admittedly, if we were familiar with\Nit, we would not dare tell a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.96,0:18:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether we know it or not,\Nwe'll always be pursued.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.72,0:18:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That having been said, it leaves us with\Njust one choice, and that is to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.48,0:18:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,His final message before his\Ndeparture were these simple words.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.46,0:18:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.92,0:18:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Open Wano's borders.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.98,0:18:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But why would he ask for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.34,0:18:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The land of Wano was\Nsealed from the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.84,0:18:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How shameful that our duty\Nwas to protect Lord Odin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.22,0:18:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, in the end,\Nit was he who saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.22,0:18:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we must go on with\Nthis terrible disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.14,0:18:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We have shamed ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.50,0:18:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Our only solution is to ensure that\Nour master's dying wish is carried out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We must kill the current\NShogun of Wano and
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.40,0:19:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,open the closed borders\Nof our dear country.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.30,0:19:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Achieving said feat is our deepest desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.80,0:19:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet we're in a quandary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.70,0:19:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Due to the combined strength\Nof the Shogun and Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.10,0:19:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wano's stuck in a Loguetown.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.22,0:19:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Back at home, the seeds of\Nrebellion are slowly being sown.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.20,0:19:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet we fall short.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.04,0:19:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Our numbers are lacking as of yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.30,0:19:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And our victory is a distant hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.36,0:19:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I see quite the dilemma.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.24,0:19:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Still we all must win.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.26,0:19:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is why in order to search\Nfor allies that might assist us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.26,0:19:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We turned our attention to the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.62,0:19:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Our initial destination was to be Zo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.56,0:19:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he speaks of our special bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.22,0:19:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki clan and the Mink\Ntribe have been aligned for ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.98,0:19:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And swore a pact to join our fates as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.28,0:19:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Above all else, me and the mutt here\Nwere Lord Odin's direct vassals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.82,0:19:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since Raizo showed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.06,0:20:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,every one of our soldiers were\Nprepared for an inevitable war.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.58,0:20:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,However, we underestimated the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.38,0:20:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It only took one of Kaido's troops\Nto leave us in this main state.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.24,0:20:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack alone was too much for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.32,0:20:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,An embarrassing reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.34,0:20:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, you're a disgrace, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.86,0:20:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, they pulled a dirty trick on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.32,0:20:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to beat yourself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.92,0:20:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.83,0:20:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,how could you have possibly known they\Nwere going to use that awful poison gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.22,0:20:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, sportsmanship\Ndoes not apply to wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how vicious their game\Nplan, this is still our home country.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.46,0:20:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.56,0:20:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall not make the\Nsame mistake next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.52,0:20:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, we'll be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.42,0:20:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They shall soon realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.80,0:20:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They've yet to see our full potential as\Nwe still have one final ace up our sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.26,0:21:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a request of you, Sir Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.90,0:21:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, Sir Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.70,0:21:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It pains me greatly to ask a favor\Nafter you have saved our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.72,0:21:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But your strength has astounded\Nme time and time again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.90,0:21:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Undesperate, Sir Luffy, we need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.44,0:21:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,As well as your crew, I beg you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.02,0:21:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,help us slay the Shogun of Wano and\Nstrike down Kaido of the Four Emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.26,0:21:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.30,0:21:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all about this kind of alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.72,0:21:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The Samurai and the Meek Tribe?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.84,0:21:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's a lot of power at our disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.02,0:21:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, we were gonna kick Kaido's\Nass sooner or later, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.20,0:21:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we gotta get in on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.20,0:21:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They have a ninja! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.34,0:21:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.78,0:22:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.46,0:22:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But they are friends, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.46,0:22:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need me to walk you\Nthrough why this is a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.26,0:22:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't pass this off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.72,0:22:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not rush into a no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.50,0:22:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is about unity!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.06,0:22:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna talk some sense into my buddy,\Nso could you give me a few minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.20,0:22:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.34,0:22:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you should accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.42,0:22:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Or else we'll lose all\Nour respect for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.50,0:22:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.46,0:22:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that Luffy\Nactually has a point here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.66,0:22:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.64,0:22:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, we should negotiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.40,0:22:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, don't you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.16,0:22:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.36,0:22:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A figurehead? Huh, Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.16,0:22:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.46,0:22:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in charge, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.62,0:22:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you the leader of these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.76,0:22:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something already!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.52,0:23:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You just gonna cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.74,0:23:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making him cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.10,0:23:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop yelling at him, you big bully!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.86,0:23:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.92,0:23:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're expecting far too much of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.82,0:23:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Heirs don't typically take\Nover the responsibilities
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.62,0:23:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,of leadership until they come of age.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.86,0:23:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's best if we\Nlet the adults confer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.72,0:23:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Momonosuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.74,0:23:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, sweet little Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.66,0:23:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.58,0:23:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.50,0:23:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Our idiot captain likes to\Nrun his mouth sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.00,0:23:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaze out upon it, Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.36,0:24:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the world, wider\Nthan your imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.72,0:24:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.26,0:24:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded, I fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.04,0:24:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.62,0:24:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready the flaming arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.82,0:24:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You must flee!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.80,0:24:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow the escape route!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.44,0:24:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, vacate!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.24,0:24:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father truly is?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.06,0:24:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A fool of a lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.28,0:24:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to vanquish Everikido!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.78,0:24:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He was an enemy to both of my parents!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.10,0:25:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And also responsible for\Ntheir untimely deaths!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.62,0:25:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I want nothing more than to\Ngrow up and become strong so
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.70,0:25:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,that I may one day smite him\Nand avenge my mother and father!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.90,0:25:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish to protect my\Nloyal servants as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.22,0:25:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.98,0:25:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This little guy's grit,\Nhe's moved me to tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.02,0:25:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You Karoo are soft in your old age.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.44,0:25:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your muzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.14,0:25:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I'm powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.90,0:25:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too small to assist in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.86,0:25:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I must ask, will\Nyou please help me fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.40,0:25:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Please loopy, I beg of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.40,0:25:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.64,0:25:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.84,0:26:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's team up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.24,0:26:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave Kaido to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.78,0:26:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's an alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.98,0:26:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you from the bottom of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.96,0:26:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I am unworthy of such kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.62,0:26:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.26,0:26:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab it tight like this. Go bam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.16,0:26:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot thank you enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.34,0:26:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, with more oomph.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.14,0:26:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I am grabbing your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.16,0:26:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.64,0:26:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I now see the point he was making.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.36,0:26:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Go-roo-nya-nya-nya!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.12,0:26:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,An alliance is born.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.12,0:26:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's break out the booze and party.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.62,0:26:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.96,0:26:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have run this by me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.40,0:26:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cool, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.56,0:26:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It is, but still, how alleviating.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.56,0:26:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we should reflect\Nupon our attitudes. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.88,0:27:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We were guilty of infantilizing him,\Nbut he is the head of the Kozuki clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.56,0:27:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,is he not?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.50,0:27:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Our drive to protect him had us\Noverlooking something so vital.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.34,0:27:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,True, Sir Luffy butted heads with a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.50,0:27:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But remarkably, he also gave\Nhim the courage to be a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.10,0:27:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He is truly amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.90,0:27:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,True indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.04,0:27:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I now understand your\Nrespect for this pirate. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.10,0:27:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.01,0:27:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's gather around.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.14,0:27:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.22,0:27:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we all ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.04,0:27:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna kick Emperor\NKaido's ass together!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.74,0:28:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Zero, the Ninja Pirate\NMink Samurai Alliance!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.44,0:28:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a mouthful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.24,0:28:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we need the ninja part?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.54,0:28:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course we do!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.12,0:28:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.92,0:28:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The target's Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.96,0:28:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.68,0:28:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Dogstorm, Catviper, Momo, Kin'emon,\NKanjuro, Ninja Guy, and Traffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.50,0:28:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about Kaido, but\Nwith an alliance like this, he's toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.34,0:28:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.92,0:28:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, don't you ever\Nbow your heads to me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.16,0:28:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.18,0:29:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Us being allies means...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.42,0:29:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,we're best friends, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.82,0:29:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We are not!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.92,0:29:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we're working together,\Nthere is one condition. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.28,0:29:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.88,0:29:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps that should have been\Nmentioned to us beforehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.62,0:29:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.50,0:29:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we go anywhere, my\Ncrew's down a man right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.58,0:29:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.54,0:29:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is about Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.28,0:29:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.50,0:29:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that is a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.58,0:29:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugara?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.49,0:29:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mean the Big Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.98,0:29:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.58,0:29:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It all went down while\NYugara were napping.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.10,0:29:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna run off and\Nrescue him real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.70,0:29:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So hold off on fighting until I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.34,0:29:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, that's your only condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.66,0:29:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's all, then\Nwe shall gladly stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.36,0:29:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.27,0:29:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's as strong as a thousand people.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.10,0:29:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me when I say this'll be worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.30,0:30:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm worth 2,000 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.34,0:30:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.82,0:30:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.90,0:30:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd be quite the asset.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.40,0:30:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,However, take precaution.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.14,0:30:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.24,0:30:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not planning on fighting her,\Nand besides, I'll take Lion Viper.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.30,0:30:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.44,0:30:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.86,0:30:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nyah-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.68,0:30:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Viper?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.20,0:30:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nyah-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.92,0:30:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The miracles never cease\Ntoday, do they? No joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.96,0:30:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We couldn't predict this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.00,0:30:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two had a rivalry so\Nstrong they found it easier
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.82,0:30:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,to split the day in half\Nrather than see each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.26,0:30:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but they have finally settled\Ntheir differences—hard
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.82,0:30:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,to believe—the moment has finally come,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.84,0:30:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and we're here to witness it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.16,0:30:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Supposedly, master Cat Viper and Duke\NDogstorm are once an inseparable pair;
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.26,0:31:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,however, one day they came back\Nfrom a long voyage, barely alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.04,0:31:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,barely alive
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.62,0:31:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And it was like they had been\Nfighting all their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.80,0:31:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Any time they even shared a glance,\Nit would cause an altercation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.52,0:31:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What could have happened between them?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.74,0:31:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All that happened before\NI was born, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.28,0:31:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That'd be correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.80,0:31:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Pager and I were only little children when\Nthose two returned from their journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.42,0:31:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Our two kings are friends again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.36,0:31:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's throw a big feast!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.30,0:31:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can wake up or go to\Nsleep whenever we please!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.70,0:31:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We have confirmation on\Nthe target, Master Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.96,0:31:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I can't see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.98,0:31:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.72,0:31:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.80,0:31:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'd have to come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.12,0:32:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheep's head,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.40,0:32:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you to return to me and\Nreport that Rhizo was not on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.74,0:32:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ming tribe is quite hardy. Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.74,0:32:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,what would happen if\Nthose who escaped the gas
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.68,0:32:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,were able to nurse the\Nothers back to health?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.16,0:32:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That idiot better keep his mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.98,0:32:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If Master Jack finds out that they\Nsurvived and we got our asses handed to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.24,0:32:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,then we're screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.68,0:32:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,When someone's on the brink of death,\Nyou have to see it all the way through.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.22,0:32:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mercy only breeds vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.10,0:32:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.06,0:32:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're already\Nweakened, this'll be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.84,0:32:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll put the stragglers\Nout of their misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.20,0:32:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.00,0:32:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll kill the elephant.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.76,0:33:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
